---
title: Layered matcha sponge cake
cuisine: Japanese
---

Prepare @./matcha-cake{1 sheet}, then cut it into 3 equal layers.

Place the first layer on a serving plate and spread an equal amount of @./matcha-white-chocolate-frosting{} over it. Repeat with the second and third layers. Place in the refrigerator for ~{30 minutes} to set the frosting.

Take out and pour @./matcha-white-chocolate-ganache{} over the top of the cake, allowing it to drip down the sides. Let set in the fridge for another ~{30 minutes}.

Using a sharp knife, cut off the edges of the cake to create a clean look.
